WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.640
Hello, Pennsylvania, Conan O'Brien here

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.170
reminding you to register to vote.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:08.173
Listen, PA. Can I call you PA?

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:10.970
No? Oh, sorry.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:14.340
Pennsylvania, you're one of
the original 13 colonies.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:18.360
You started this democracy
and now it's in trouble.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.270
We need you.

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:22.430
We can't leave voting to
places like the West Coast.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:25.270
We've got earthquakes and
Kardashians to deal with.

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:30.090
We need the OG 13 to step
up and vote like hell.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.900
Every election year the pundits
go on and on about Florida.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.470
They gotta win Florida.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:37.110
Well, I'm sick of hearing about Florida.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.210
F Florida.

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.240
What about Pennsylvania?

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.580
I say you can't win the White House

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.680
if you don't win Pennsylvania.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:49.520
So please register to
vote by October 19th.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.890
So you can decide who wins the White House

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:54.480
and piss off Florida.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.100
Still not convinced?

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.690
Listen to this joke.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:01.310
The Monongahela River in
Western Pennsylvania flows north

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:05.665
and the first time you see it
you think, wow, that is Erie.

00:01:06.609 --> 00:01:09.620
Register to vote, or I'll come
to Erie and tell that joke

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:11.790
and only that joke in person

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:14.380
at the D'Angelo Performance Arts Center.

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:18.900
You have until October 19th to
register to vote and stop me.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:22.457
You can do it online@whenweallvote.org.

